WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:03.419
This next story is one of it's been a serious
show.

00:00:03.419 --> 00:00:07.990
This is one of those funny stories that is
really more about Donald Trump's fragility

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:09.350
than it is about anything else.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:13.379
Donald Trump has suddenly backed out of throwing
out a first pitch at an upcoming New York

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:14.950
Yankees baseball game.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.140
Now, there are three different reasons why.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:21.070
And you can say that it's all three or just
one or two.

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.600
You know, take your pick.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:27.060
First of all, I believe Trump is worried that
he's going to really screw up the first pitch

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.730
and he's going to be, again, in an embarrassing,
laughing stock.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.649
Trump is claiming that he's going to be too
busy to do it.

00:00:33.649 --> 00:00:39.149
He tweeted yesterday, quote, Because of my
strong focus on the China virus, including

00:00:39.149 --> 00:00:44.559
scheduled meetings on vaccines, our economy
and much else, I won't be able to be in New

00:00:44.559 --> 00:00:48.109
York to throw out the opening pitch for the
Yankees on August 15th.

00:00:48.109 --> 00:00:50.140
We will make it later in the season.

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:51.819
So this is not credible.

00:00:51.819 --> 00:00:56.800
This is the guy who just golfed for the 280
second day during his presidency.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.319
He says he's going to be too busy working
now to throw out a pitch, which takes five

00:01:00.319 --> 00:01:01.319
minutes.

00:01:01.319 --> 00:01:02.319
He's so fragile.

00:01:02.319 --> 00:01:03.519
I guess he has to travel to New York.

00:01:03.519 --> 00:01:04.869
He's so fragile.

00:01:04.869 --> 00:01:07.500
He's afraid of what will be a disastrous pitch.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.689
So that's number one.

00:01:08.689 --> 00:01:11.130
Now, I want to be clear.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.149
This is not about.

00:01:12.149 --> 00:01:13.259
Wait a second, David.

00:01:13.259 --> 00:01:17.460
You complain Trump doesn't do any work and
now you complain that he's going to be working

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.080
instead of throwing out a pitch.

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.250
You're being a hypocrite.

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:22.509
Now, Trump's just lying again.

00:01:22.509 --> 00:01:26.340
We know Trump doesn't skip things that he
thinks will make him look good or that are

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:28.600
fun for him because he has to work.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.600
He's golfed.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:31.859
Two hundred and eighty two different days
during his presidency.

00:01:31.859 --> 00:01:35.979
Trump is skipping this because especially
after his skills playing catch were ridiculed

00:01:35.979 --> 00:01:40.509
last week when he tossed the ball around with
former Yankee Mariano Rivera.

00:01:40.509 --> 00:01:44.659
He knows he could come up with an embarrassing
first pitch and it would be really bad.

00:01:44.659 --> 00:01:48.079
He is scared someone might realize maybe Trump
isn't the alpha male.

00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:49.200
He makes himself out to be.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.229
But here's the thing.

00:01:51.229 --> 00:01:55.030
If you don't think that's the reason why Trump
isn't going to do it.

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:57.960
There's another reason, which is Trump doesn't
want to get booed.

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:00.100
We're talking about New York City.

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:05.030
Trump was getting brutally booed at sporting
events before Corona virus.

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:10.619
He was not losing to Biden by 10 and he was
getting destroyed when he went.

00:02:10.619 --> 00:02:13.050
Sporting events with just brutal boos.

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:17.000
He was going to get obliterated with boos
at Yankee Stadium.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.310
So it's the pitch itself that he'd likely
mess up.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:24.610
Plus, getting brutally booed at Yankee Stadium
and it being repeated on TV for hours.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:31.680
But if you don't like either of those explanations,
entire baseball teams have been kneeling during

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:35.800
the national anthem in the early days of this
new Major League Baseball season.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:41.830
It's another reason Trump doesn't want to
be there for that, because, again, Trump would

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:46.480
be out there with his hand over his heart,
trying to remember the words, the national

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:54.620
anthem, while all or most of the players would
be kneeling in another direct rebuke of Donald

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:55.620
Trump.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:59.370
So those pick which of these are all three
of these reasons.

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:02.170
Of course, Trump is bailing on throwing out
the first pitch.

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:09.170
And anyway, imagine claiming you're too busy
to throw out a pitch the day after retweeting,

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:10.510
as he did on Saturday.

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:18.459
A picture of himself and former NFL quarterback
Brett Farve playing golf as 77000 new Corona

00:03:18.459 --> 00:03:22.410
virus cases had been announced the previous
day in the United States.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:28.730
It just doesn't pass the sniff test that Donald
Trump is not doing this because he's too busy.

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:30.189
He's just too fragile for me.

00:03:30.189 --> 00:03:31.980
You know, we need a stronger president now.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:32.980
I'm not talking.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:33.980
Physically.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:34.980
I'm talking intellectually.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:38.230
I'm talking emotionally, personality wise.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.989
Trump is just too fragile for me.

00:03:39.989 --> 00:04:54.650
